Subject: [PATCH] test(claude-eval): G220-5 Qdrant generation probes

Pinned: rebuild switches the alias and keeps the old generation; a verified
upsert racing a rebuild is never reported verified. Strict xfail Q1
(medium): rebuild() drops canonical_sha256/embedding_id/generation, so no
point is verifiable after a rebuild. Q2 (low): public delete() and
provenance-less upsert() remain on the adapter.

